  "details": "🔹 Suggestion: Add a Dedicated \"18+\" Category in VRChat\n\nTo improve content discovery and safety, VRChat should introduce a clearly labeled \"18+\" category for adult-only worlds. This would allow mature users to freely explore nightlife, roleplay, and social experiences meant for adults — while helping protect minors from entering inappropriate instances.\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Easier access to adult-themed content for verified users\n\n* Clear separation between general and mature content\n\n* Safer experience for all age groups\n\nAdding this category would support responsible community growth and creative freedom.",
